---
import WalletApp from '../components/WalletApp.svelte';

export const prerender = false;

const accept = Astro.request.headers.get('accept') || '';
let prefersMarkdown = false;
if (accept.includes('text/markdown')) {
  prefersMarkdown = true;
  if (accept.includes('text/html')) {
    let qMd = 1.0;
    let qHtml = 1.0;
    for (const part of accept.split(',')) {
      const p = part.trim();
      if (p.startsWith('text/markdown')) {
        const m = p.match(/q=([0-9.]+)/);
        if (m) qMd = parseFloat(m[1]);
      } else if (p.startsWith('text/html')) {
        const m = p.match(/q=([0-9.]+)/);
        if (m) qHtml = parseFloat(m[1]);
      }
    }
    if (qHtml > qMd) prefersMarkdown = false;
  }
}

if (prefersMarkdown) {
  return new Response(`# Rights & Renewals Sovereign App

> Offline-first, encrypted consumer rights vault, warranty countdown tracker, and § 312k cancellation generator.

## Core Capabilities
- **Encrypted Local Vault**: Client-side AES-GCM-256 storage for purchase receipts and warranties.
- **Statutory Deadlines**: 12-month Beweislastumkehr (§ 477 Abs. 1 BGB) & 24-month Gewährleistung (§ 438 BGB).
- **Dual-Rail Cancellation**: Deterministic DIN 5008 PDF dossier compilation and verified cancellation button links (§ 312k BGB).
- **Browser-local WebMCP demos**: \`vault_lookup\` and \`notice_generate\` register through \`document.modelContext\` when the browser supports it. They do not access local vault records or call a remote service.

## Wallet API routes
- \`POST /api/auth/request-pin\`: Starts the wallet PIN challenge flow.
- \`POST /api/auth/verify-pin\`: Verifies a PIN challenge and establishes the wallet session.
- \`GET /api/calendar/subscriptions.ics\` and \`GET /api/calendar/warranties.ics\`: Public sample iCalendar feeds.
- \`GET /api/ical/subscriptions/{token}\` and \`GET /api/ical/warranties/{token}\`: Tokenized iCalendar feed routes. Current handlers return sample entries, not private browser vault records.

## Service boundary
This Pages wallet does not host remote MCP, OAuth authorize/token/JWKS, client-registration, or health endpoints. Remote policy MCP discovery and policy agent skills belong to the separate showcase service; use its own discovery documents to locate those resources. The wallet does not provide remote vault read or write access.

## Wallet discovery resources
- API Catalog: \`/.well-known/api-catalog\`
- API Guide: \`/auth.md\`
`, {
    status: 200,
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'text/markdown; charset=utf-8',
      'Vary': 'Accept',
      'Link': '</.well-known/api-catalog>; rel="api-catalog", </auth.md>; rel="service-doc"',
      'Access-Control-Allow-Origin': '*',
      'x-markdown-tokens': '230'
    }
  });
}
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de" data-theme="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0B3B4C" />
  <meta name="description" content="Rights & Renewals (CM-LAB): Sovereign Consumer Rights, Subscription & Tax-Ready Wallet PWA" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="64x64" href="/favicon.png" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" />
  <title>Rights &amp; Renewals — BGB Fristen, Kündigung &amp; Steuern</title>

  <style is:global>
    @import '@cmlab/design-tokens/tokens.css';

    :root {
      --height-viewport: 100dvh;
      --padding-safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 16px);
      --padding-safe-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: inherit;
    }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      background-color: var(--color-surface-canvas, #F4F7F6);
      color: var(--color-text-primary, #0F172A);
      font-family: var(--font-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    }

    /* 12-Column Responsive Grid Contract */
    .grid-12-col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-4, 16px);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: var(--space-4, 16px);
      padding-bottom: calc(var(--space-12, 48px) + var(--padding-safe-bottom));
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .grid-12-col {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--space-3, 12px);
        padding: var(--space-3, 12px);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="app-shell">
  <!-- Greenfield Svelte 5 Single Root Island Router -->
  <WalletApp client:only="svelte" />

  <noscript>
    <header role="banner" id="app-header">
      <div role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" id="omnibar-root"></div>
    </header>
    <main id="app-dashboard-grid" class="grid-12-col">
      <div style="padding: 24px; text-align: center; color: #7F1D1D; background: #FEE2E2; margin: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
        <h2>JavaScript Required</h2>
        <p>CM-LAB Sovereign Consumer Wallet requires JavaScript for 100% client-side IndexedDB encryption and BGB statutory calculations.</p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </noscript>
</body>
</html>
